      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我要参加德比，并且要获胜！\n谱写出不亚于前辈们的故事就是我的梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4b3e729229bb9727adc4aa845bc6a0eed9034b0f07b8d8c3bfdf179578211c6",
